      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100720064006F006E0020003F0020004A2019006100690020006D0061006E0071007500E900200075006E002000E9007000690073006F006400650020003F00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon, je n’ai pas tout compris, mais j’aimerais\nque tu accordes un combat à Brutalibré.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nIl a l’air d’y tenir !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
