      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne vais plus me contenter de te nourrir.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’ai envie d’en apprendre plus sur ce que c’est\nd’être Dresseuse.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je veux vraiment t’épauler !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007600650075007800200076007200610069006D0065006E007400200074201900E9007000610075006C006500720020002100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bruta !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420072007500740061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai hâte qu’on s’entraîne ensemble !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019006100690020006800E2007400650020007100752019006F006E0020007320190065006E00740072006100EE006E006500200065006E00730065006D0062006C00650020002100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci de tout cœur d’avoir disputé ce combat\ncontre Brutalibré !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500720063006900200064006500200074006F007500740020006301530075007200200064201900610076006F00690072002000640069007300700075007400E900200063006500200063006F006D006200610074000A0063006F006E007400720065002000420072007500740061006C00690062007200E90020002100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je craignais que ce soit difficile pour les Pokémon\nsauvages de vivre en ville, mais j’avais tort :<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nils sont forts et savent se débrouiller !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
